governor turn 1: plan -> movie, watchlist-store, watchlist, app, movie-detail, search  (Field-only rename: the watchlist items' `watched` flag becomes `seen` in the interfaces, store logic, persisted payload, and any component references. Exported identifiers (`toggleWatched`, `watchedCount`) and user-visible text are deliberately kept, since the request names the item field, not the API surface. movie, watchlist-store and watchlist certainly touch the field; app, movie-detail and search get conditional instructions in case they reference it (tsc will catch anything missed). Acceptance tests pin the new interface shapes and the store's seen-flag semantics plus persisted format.)
round 1: owners movie=ok watchlist-store=ok watchlist=rejected app=ok movie-detail=ok search=ok; oracle RED
